---
// Hero / intro section. Top of the single-page scroll.
---

<section class="hero" id="me" aria-label="Introduction">
  <h1>Sandeep <em>Danda</em></h1>
  <p class="location">
    <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Seattle,+WA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <svg class="pin" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M20 10c0 7-8 13-8 13s-8-6-8-13a8 8 0 0 1 16 0z"/>
        <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/>
      </svg>
      Seattle
    </a>
    · Software Development Engineer
  </p>
  <p class="tagline">
    I build the boring, reliable stuff at Amazon - the systems you only
    notice when they break, and mostly they don't. Off the clock: cooking,
    badminton, and PNW trails. Currently curious about AI tooling and the
    thirty seconds right before a deploy.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    margin: 0 0 3.5rem 0;
    scroll-margin-top: 5rem;
  }
  .location {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 1.25rem 0 1.75rem 0;
  }
  .location a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-bottom: 1px;
    transition: color 150ms ease-out, border-color 150ms ease-out;
  }
  .location a:hover {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .pin {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    max-width: 12px;
    max-height: 12px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 6.5rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 0.95;
    margin: 0;
  }
  h1 em {
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .tagline {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.2vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-text);
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
</style>
